\begin_layout Description
Mengapa
\begin_inset space ~
\end_inset

ekuivalen? 
\begin_inset CommandInset label
LatexCommand label
name "que:whyEquivalent"

\end_inset

Persamaan 
\begin_inset Formula $g(x)=0$
\end_inset

 dan 
\begin_inset Formula $f(x)=x$
\end_inset

 memiliki himpunan penyelesaian yang sama persis.
 
\begin_inset Formula $g(x)=0\Leftrightarrow1-x^{3}=0\Leftrightarrow1=x^{3}\Leftrightarrow\frac{1}{x^{2}}=x\Leftrightarrow f(x)=x$
\end_inset

.
